Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:37.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星河战队3：掠夺者》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,（联邦联播网）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,（虫虫大战2）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,（虫族新武器）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝎子级脉冲战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scorpion-class pulse warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,神风轰炸甲虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kamikaze bombardiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,战场上每天都有新虫族出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day, new Bugs show up on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！趴下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! Get down, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多到让人不禁纳闷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many that some wonder:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快打输了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we losing this war?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号GIQ{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}GIQ on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打赌 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bet on it, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在欧朋汉默测试场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here at Oppenheimer Proving Grounds…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦科学家正在酝酿一些突袭…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…federal scientists are cooking up some nasty top-secret surprises…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,…恶心的最高机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道更多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.34,0:01:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但机动步兵团的最新武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the newest weapon in the Mobile Infantry's arsenal…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一点都不机密的铲子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is the not-so-secret shovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族火力更大就需要琐沟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greater Bug firepower means trenches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,意即在罗库山挖琐沟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means digging here on Roku San…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个曾经和平的农场星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this once peaceful farm planet…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.05,0:01:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经变成二次虫战的新前线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that has become the new frontline of the Second Bug War.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 士兵 用力挖吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, trooper. And put your back into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,（反战者处死）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,反对战争就是反对我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're against the war, you're against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.47,0:01:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,（叛徒）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位联邦法官今天如是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what a federal judge said today…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他宣布对于任何质疑 联邦道德的人来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he declared that hanging is absolutely good enough…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,绞刑算是客气的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for anyone who threatens the morale of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部处以死刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And death. Execute them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,（联邦法院法务部长奇瓦）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:02:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很简单的判决 做人讲话要小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very simple ruling. People need to watch what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾诺萝菲德上将 舰队情报局局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Enolo Phid, division chief, Fleet Intelligence…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天在地球司令总部 透露另一项隐忧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…voiced another concern from her headquarters at Terran Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果宗教崇拜的复苏 在这里与外太空殖民地…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The revival of religious worship here and in the outer colonies…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…会造成煽动或任何方式的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will not be tolerated if it leads to sedition…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…动摇我们战争期间的努力 都是不被容许的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or in any other way destabilizes our war effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道更多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.47,0:02:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很黑 很英俊 是通灵战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dark, he's handsome, he's psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇气 负责 荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courage, duty, honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如鹰一般翱翔天际{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eagle high above.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是欧马艾诺克将军 人见人爱的空军指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's General Omar Anoke, the sky marshal everyone loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们力量 蠃得这场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And gives us strength To go and win this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在昨晚的战争集会上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at last night's war rally…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.15,0:02:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他震撼了全联邦的听众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he thrilled audiences all across the Federation…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:44.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,激昂演出他最新畅销曲 《慷慨赴义就在今天》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a pounding rendition of his latest hit, "A Good Day to Die."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为正义而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight for what is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,崇高的牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A noble sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了就义无反顾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When duty calls, you pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿为联邦奉献生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the Federation I will give my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,慷慨赴义就在今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good day to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你知道为何而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you know the reasons why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要为正义而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens we foght for what is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.01,0:03:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在可以歌颂 空军指挥官艾诺克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hey, citizen, now you can celebrate Sky Marshal Anoke…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时支援我们的武力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and support our war effort at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为每天都是购物的好日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's always a good day to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我愿奉献生命 - 勇气 负责 荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will give my life - Courage, duty, honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿为联邦奉献生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the Federation I will give my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想买更多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to buy more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,（军援司令部 罗库山）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌袭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退开！- 快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear out! - Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走吗 大兵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you walk, soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以 长官 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙 捡起那只手臂 查出是谁的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a hand. Pick up that arm and find out who it belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快 我们要在 两小时内完工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mop up, people. We got brass up our ass in T-minus-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚要抽查吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise inspection, sir? Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军指挥官随时会来查验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The SM can drop in and count the sheets any time he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军指挥官要来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sky marshal's coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦尼恩少尉 你敢叫他签名 我就开枪射你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him for an autograph, Lieutenant Manion, and I will have you shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. Of course not, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官到 - 继续工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Officer on deck. - Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Status?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚契又在测试围蜥 - 笨虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Archie's testing the fence again, sir. - Stupid Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是讨厌不是笨 少尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pesky, not stupid, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续加油 亚契 我早上要烤虫族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it up, Archie. I like my Bugs fried in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰艇下来了 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boat coming down, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮绷紧了 士兵们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look sharp, troopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 空军指挥官是联邦最高机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the sky marshal is the Federation's top-secret top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他要来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how'd you know he was coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾诺克的参谋长 以前是帮我擦鞋的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anoke's chief of staff used to polish my brass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识豪泽将军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know General Hauzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄克斯豪泽也曾经是 像你一样的笨少尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dix Hauzer was a dope lieutenant just like you once upon a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年就当将军 真厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made general in two years. Some dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花八年才当到上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only took me eight years to make colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强尼瑞哥 - 你好 狄克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John Rico. - Good to see you, Dix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.34,0:06:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going? - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要介绍你认识一个人 我想我恋爱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to introduce you to someone. I think I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？谁啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Who'd have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了 动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he comes, everybody. Let's go, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉无预警的跑来 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to drop in unannounced, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有感觉 你预料到我会来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet I sense you expect my visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍仔细了 中士 强尼瑞哥 P星球的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in tight on this, sergeant. Johnny Rico, our hero of Planet P.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是尽本份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did my part, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:07:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 英雄激发勇气与牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Heroes inspire courage, sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 牺牲？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sacrifice? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我们做得更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By asking us to be better than what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我罗库山的情况 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about Roku San, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些农夫会打仗吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will these farmers fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要我们 但不喜欢我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need us, but they don't like us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,心比脑袋更善变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearts are more fickle than minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝拉贝克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola Beck?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是空军指挥官的驾驶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fly the SM.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要最好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解我的 强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know me, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我了解你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长就是 稍早我提到的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck is the person I was talking about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟萝拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lola?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长 你该告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck, you should have informed me…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟瑞哥上校的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of your relationship with Colonel Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是公私分明的 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I do out of uniform is off the clock, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三位显然 有很多事要讨论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You three obviously have much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请他们喝一杯 上校 算我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy them both a drink on me, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是麦尼恩少尉？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lieutenant Manion, isn't it? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不介意带我巡视吧？- 我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Care to give me the post tour? - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的歌我都有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have all your songs, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去吧 少尉 - 好的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carry on, lieutenant. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 长官都下令了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kids. We got orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是我认识 最大个儿的女孩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys are the biggest girls I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想它们是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.53,0:08:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫子？我讨厌它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugs? I hate them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢他们不了解的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no one likes what they can't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是往想像力去看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just look at the imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的创意十足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sheer virtuosity of their creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰您 可以请您在我头盔签名吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to bother you, sir, but could you please sign my helmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢长官 - 不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, sir. - Anytime, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们今天的数量多了很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there sure are a lot more of them at the wire today, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,多了很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许它们听说了我要唱歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe they heard I was going to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官到 - 注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Officer on deck. - Look sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你跟某个 不是农夫的人搞混了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me confused with someone who isn't a farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:10:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎样能弄到那种帽子？- 加入军队尽一份力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do I get me a hat like that? - Join up, do your part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,农夫嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要问你一件事 - 抱歉 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd like to ask you something. - Sorry, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.81,0:10:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请他们喝一杯 拿瓶酒给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy them a drink on me, will you? And bring us a bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,安份点 哈朗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hose your cage, Harlan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.65,0:10:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种人会害我们 输掉这场战争的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the kind of people who will lose this war for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么外太空殖民地的人 都不想作战？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it no one in the outer colonies wants to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗库山曾是个好地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roku San used to be a nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在成了战场 他们怪到我们头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's war, and they blame us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚契今晚发飚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archie's cooking tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们在想什么？- 亚契不会思考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they thinking? - Archie don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是烤虫的好日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good day to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 立正 - 稍息 士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ten-hut. - At ease, troopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们今晚似乎很兴奋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem so excited tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该听听它们的声音 它们在外头哀号呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to hear them, sir. They're howling out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,放出来 士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, put them on the line, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.73,0:11:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我们受到测试 少尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we're being tested, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试我们的忠诚 智慧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our loyalty, our intelligence…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有想像力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…our imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 长官 我弟弟真的很崇拜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir. My brother really loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 他叫什么名字？- 凯文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. What's his name? - Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信他会是很棒的新兵 - 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sure he'll make a fine recruit. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以麻烦你吗？- 当然没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I, sir? - Of course you can, trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦尼恩上尉 你敢请他签名 我就开枪射你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him for an autograph, Lieutenant Manion, and I will have you shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬强尼 P星球的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To John, hero of Planet P.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝拉 两艘船被你击落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola, two ships shot out from under you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是做办公桌的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fly a goddamn desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打的是数字战 我做的就是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The battles I fight are with numbers. That's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的就是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这里的人不站出来 我们就会沉船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that if everyone in here doesn't step up, we're sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敬联邦 - 敬联邦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To the Federation. - The Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,“敬联邦”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To the Federation."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞哥和我结识时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rico and I met…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼是大战英雄 我才六年级{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when Johnny was a big war hero and I was still a six.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业旅行 八天十个星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond tour. Ten planets, eight days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.74,0:12:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得乌龟湾吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember Turtle Bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄克斯 你怎么认识约翰的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dix, how do you know Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前在地球司令部是我上司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he used to be my boss at TCOM.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准职位调动 我生命中最糟的一年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard rotation. Worst year of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄克斯每天都在 帮我收烂摊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dix saved my ass every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,处决时间到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's hanging time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,上诉让人精疲力尽 他们都已和家人道别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appeals are exhausted. Their families have said goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的就是伏法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that remains is payment for their crimes against you, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.61,0:13:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,资深绞刑执行官慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senior executive executioner is taking his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是在给讯息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending a message, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我们大家今晚深思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One for all of us to contemplate this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的想法不论多讨人喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That our ideas, no matter how pleasing…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是危险的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会产生行动与后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there are actions and consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That no one really counts very much…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们顾全大局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…unless we are part of something bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是正义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is, justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会付出代价的 上帝做我的见证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll pay. As God is my witness, you'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.17,0:14:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back off. - Hold on, hold on, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 联邦的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fuck off, feddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没搞懂 这是很清楚的教训{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys fail to understand a very clear lesson here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要教训我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something to learn me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狄克斯 我们走吧 - 瑞哥上校 请你放尊重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Dix, let's get out of here. - Colonel Rico, if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫军警 我要逮捕他们 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}MPs, now. I want them arrested. Everyone. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官 中士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到将军的话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 你没大过联邦政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends, you're not bigger than the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲话小心一点 叫你做什么就照做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch what you say and do what you're told.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:15:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不然你要吊死我们吗？- 这由你决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or you'll have us hung, is that it? - It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄克斯 我们带萝拉走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dix. Let's get Lola out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你属下了 强尼 退下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for you anymore, John. Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到没有？退下 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that, everybody? Stand down. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 我自己处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, I take my own lumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你违反了第五条款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're in violation of Article 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,第八条款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Article 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够了吗？- 退下 瑞哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Had enough? - Stand down, Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,第十一条款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Article 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一条款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你成为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes you subject to…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …特别命令86的对象 - 小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Special Order 86. - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞哥上校 你违反命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Rico, you're out of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请见谅 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begging the general's pardon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想阻止老朋友犯错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to keep an old friend from making an ass of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,友谊比不上职责重要 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friendship means nothing next to duty, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.11,0:16:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你忘了你的职责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have forgotten yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来杀虫的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were here to kill Bugs, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是杀农夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,依煽动罪逮捕农夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest the farmers. Sedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有瑞哥上校 - 好了 给我站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Colonel Rico too. - All right, on your feet, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罪名是不服从长官 - 狄克斯 住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Failure to obey a superior officer. - Hey, Dix, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到你的船上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,中士 你听到命令了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant, you have your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 请跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, please come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,电子系统故障{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electrical system malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了它们 它们越过围墙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they come, they're on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞哥 - 全部故障了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rico. - It's all down. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,栅栏出故障了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fence is down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 栅栏呢？- 怎么会这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The fence? - How could that have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 它们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.69,0:17:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要增援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.69,0:17:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就需要援兵 长官！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need reinforcements now, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我马上去 - 等等 你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm on my way. - Hold on. You are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你的遗言吗？- 不 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that your final word? - No, that's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们军事法庭上见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you at my court-martial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你真好 萝拉 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice seeing you, Lola. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让路 我们要出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a hole, coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it moving. Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们想活下去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you apes. You wanna live forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就防守位置 敌人来袭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defensive positions. Incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.61,0:20:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没子弹 我没子弹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of ammo, man. Out of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 虫子！- 前后列队！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bugs! - Two lines! Front and back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.17,0:20:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪榴弹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenades!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞哥上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Rico, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告状况 少尉 - 完全搞砸了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Situation, lieutenant. - Totally ominously fucked up, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把空军指挥官也跟丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I lost the sky marshal too, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们会一起被处死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. We'll all hang together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道怎么做 进去杀光它们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do. Get in there and kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.51,0:21:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 前进指挥部在哪？- 虫子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's forward command? - It's Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:21:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是虫子 到处都是虫子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Bugs. Bugs everywhere you go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.85,0:22:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你怎么在这儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了？我们得立刻送你上登陆艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you wounded? We have to get you to the lander right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.13,0:22:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大兵 快过来 我们得送空军指挥官到安全地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marines, gather around. We must get the sky marshal to safety right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.67,0:22:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 列队 这边走 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Formation. This way, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚契{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.95,0:22:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,危机解除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.57,0:22:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚契 把锁打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archie. Get that paddock open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.71,0:23:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是豪泽将军 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is General Hauzer. Open this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.58,0:23:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.69,0:23:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.02,0:23:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门关上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this door closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.49,0:23:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯医生 这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Wiggs, over here. Dr. Wiggs, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.76,0:23:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.83,0:23:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 医务兵看着雷中士 - 知道了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Corpsman, see to Sergeant Rye. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的虫子 我恨它们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Bugs. I hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.71,0:23:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯医生 前面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Wiggs. Front and center.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.05,0:23:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么了？- 小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with him? - Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受到惊吓 你没事吧 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in shock. Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.93,0:23:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:24:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will be. - Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.74,0:24:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.14,0:24:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长 我们几时离开？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck, when do we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.27,0:24:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如就现在吧 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about T-minus-now, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.38,0:24:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我请求准许 留在罗库山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, requesting permission to remain on Roku San, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.81,0:24:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想当英雄吗 狄克斯？- 总得有人留下战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trying to be a hero, Dix? - Somebody's gotta stay and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.25,0:24:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.65,0:24:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在由瑞哥上校指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Rico is in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.16,0:24:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被迫释放瑞哥上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was forced to relieve Colonel Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.56,0:24:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他原本因为 不服从上司遭到逮捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's under arrest for acts of insubordination.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.99,0:24:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是重罪 我为你朋友感到遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious charges. I'm sorry for your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.43,0:24:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你的命运 真的就在这里 狄克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps your destiny does lay here after all, Dix.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And good luck, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.81,0:24:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.61,0:24:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再考虑一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think about this for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在为我们两个做决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're making a decision for the both of us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.82,0:24:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.59,0:24:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄克斯 我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dix, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.19,0:25:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,开船离开吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast off, Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.92,0:25:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,各单位注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, all units.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.92,0:25:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是豪泽将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is General Hauzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.55,0:25:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始由我指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am assuming command effective immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.72,0:25:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,进地堡！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the bunker!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.92,0:25:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,重覆 现在由我指挥 各单位指挥官请回报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, I'm assuming command. All unit commanders report.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.03,0:25:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻报告位置与状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want location and status. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.73,0:25:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,G琐沟失守了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost G Trench, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.73,0:25:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知豪泽将军 好吗 少尉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that in a memo to General Hauzer, will you, lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.77,0:25:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.94,0:25:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是豪泽 各单位注意 我再说一遍 现在由我指挥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Hauzer to all units. I say again, I'm assuming command.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.59,0:26:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在撤退 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pulling back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.42,0:26:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴下！- 准备迎击！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! - Hit the deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.50,0:26:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.94,0:26:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,史基纳 海陶 守住那个洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinner, Hightower, cover that hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.67,0:26:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备迎击！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.41,0:26:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰炸甲虫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombardier!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝎子！是蝎子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scorp! It's a scorp!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.10,0:26:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝎子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scorpion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.57,0:26:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝎子！妈的！是蝎子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scorpion! Oh, fuck! Scorpion!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.65,0:27:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire, fire, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,榴弹枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenades!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.73,0:27:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回家吧 贝克队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us home, Captain Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.70,0:27:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,五秒后进入曲速{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp in five, number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.50,0:27:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 豪泽将军怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am. What about General Hauzer, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.74,0:28:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想战斗 听我倒数出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants combat. Take us out on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三 二 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.22,0:28:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他说 “那我们都能去睡了”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy says, "Man, then we can all get some sleep."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.59,0:28:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的亚契 真不敢相信我被咬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Archie. Can't believe I got bitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.19,0:28:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你被咬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.16,0:28:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.13,0:28:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.30,0:28:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,做的好 中士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work out there, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.37,0:28:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢长官 空军指挥官没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, ma'am. SM all okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.71,0:28:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏有你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么说 大兵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we say, marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.82,0:28:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 继续做事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.19,0:28:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.66,0:28:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里托队长 一切井然有序吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Brittles, are we shipshape?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.69,0:28:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会第一个知道的 舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be the first to know, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:28:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是打声招呼 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying hi, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.71,0:29:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那是空军指挥官的晚餐 那你先走吧 荷莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's the SM's dinner, after you, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.75,0:29:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.58,0:29:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你煮了什么 金格？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's cooking, Jingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.08,0:29:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是老样子嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the same old shit on a shingle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喝酒吗 舰长？- 我在值勤 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drink, captain? - On duty, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.97,0:29:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.37,0:29:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长 听我说一下好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck. Give a listen, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.44,0:29:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们在罗库山 遭遇沉痛的失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we have suffered grave defeat at Roku San.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.21,0:29:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相信宇宙中 存在着平衡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am confident that there exists balance in the cosmos and…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.66,0:30:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信宇宙中存在着平衡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am certain that there exists balance in the cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.53,0:30:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然失败过 我们就会胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where there is defeat, we will make victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.47,0:30:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天要向国会演说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to address the council tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.51,0:30:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 大家都爱胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir, everybody loves victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.75,0:30:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我失陪 我要回驾驶舱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me, I'll be getting back to the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.95,0:30:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你 他们就处理不来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look, can't they manage without you just for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.95,0:30:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来谈谈吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stay and talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.42,0:30:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官 我很乐意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, sir, I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.43,0:30:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从曲速摔出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're falling out of warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.35,0:30:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 为了保护您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, for your own protection…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.98,0:30:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须送您上登陆艇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm gonna need to get you to the marine lander.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.62,0:30:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷莉 跟着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holly, stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.49,0:31:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么撞上我们？- 我想我们刚才互撞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What just hit us? - I think we just hit each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.26,0:31:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 荷莉 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Holly, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.33,0:31:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 士兵 向援救甲板报到 - 了解 贝克舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marines, report to the rescue deck. - I read you, Captain Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.73,0:31:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.90,0:31:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.01,0:31:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,（高度警戒）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.08,0:31:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.95,0:31:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大兵 在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marines. Right here, brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.38,0:31:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.96,0:31:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是反应炉爆炸吗 队长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a reactor, chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.60,0:31:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是二级爆炸 一级会把我们变成阳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secondary. Number one will turn us into daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.77,0:31:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.60,0:31:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弃船 队长 - 遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abandon ship, chief. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.01,0:31:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷中士 空军指挥官跟你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Rye, the SM goes with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 长官 请跟我们来 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am. Come with us now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.24,0:31:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长 我希望你留在我身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck, I would prefer that you stay at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.91,0:32:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官 队长 带其它人去坐逃生舱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Crew chief, get everyone else to the rescue pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.75,0:32:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.68,0:32:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 厨房有点问题 - 金格 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got a little problem in the galley. - Jingo, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.49,0:32:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.59,0:32:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去接空军指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get the SM, Chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.13,0:32:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这边请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.74,0:32:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.51,0:32:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大兵 去坐你们的登陆舱 - 我们地面上见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marines, get to your lander. - I will see you on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.31,0:32:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我们走 去坐逃生舱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, people, let's move. To the rescue pod, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.18,0:32:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要坠毁了吗？- 没有 我们要去坐逃生舱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we crashing? - No, we're getting into the rescue pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.25,0:33:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,（罗库山败仗）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.45,0:33:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗库山战线 是联邦防卫的关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Roku San line, key to the Federation's defense…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.89,0:33:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚吃了败仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…knows defeat in one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.26,0:33:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了多少人？没人敢说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many dead? No man can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.16,0:33:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但专家都同意一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experts agree on one thing only:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,责任明显落在 强尼瑞哥上校身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blame falls squarely on Colonel John Rico.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.56,0:33:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,（瑞哥 P星球英雄蒙羞）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾被誉为P星球的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once heralded as the hero of Planet P.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今却蒙羞等待受审{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now disgraced and awaiting court-martial…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.30,0:33:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时囚禁在 阿拉莫湾联邦监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from his cell at the Alamo Bay Federal Detention Facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.47,0:33:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外太空殖民地 还有一场和平集会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another day, another peace rally in the outer colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.54,0:33:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦政府占尽好处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation has taken advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.01,0:33:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次不一样 因为他是艾莫戈尼夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this time it's different, because of Elmo Goniff.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.48,0:33:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是公民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm a citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.82,0:33:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,授勋老兵变成和平主义者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decorated veteran turned pacifist…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.92,0:33:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也成了日渐 壮的 公民联盟的领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and now the leader of a growing coalition of citizens…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.79,0:33:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们质疑联邦政府{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who question the Federation's administration…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.23,0:33:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成虫族冲突{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of the Arachnid conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.69,0:33:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？我在信仰找到了答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And counting. Why? I found my answers in faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:34:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的信仰是对上帝 不是人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have faith in God, not people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.33,0:34:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不计代价求和平 是人类的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace at any price is a human right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.37,0:34:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其它的代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are other costs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.41,0:34:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗库山败仗 燃起反战运动…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defeat at Roku San has fueled the anti-war movement…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…造成144名 外太空殖民地的学生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…resulting in the deaths of 144 outer-colony students…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.45,0:34:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…与虔诚的反战份子丧命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and religious protesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道更多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.38,0:34:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在带您到 地球司令部的现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We break net now to take you live to Terran Command…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.69,0:34:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军指挥官欧·艾诺克 将向联邦人民演说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where Sky Marshal Omar Anoke will address the Federation…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.89,0:34:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,交待罗库山的危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on the Roku San crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.60,0:34:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,同胞们 今天我带着 沉痛的心来到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fellow citizens, I come to you today with a heavy heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去12小时内…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within the past 12 hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.87,0:34:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们在罗库山 遭遇屈辱败仗…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we have suffered ignominious defeat at Roku San.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.21,0:34:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不服从最高指挥…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incompetence at the highest levels of command…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…遭到背叛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and betrayal…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.88,0:34:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…那些抗议 质疑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by those who would protest, question…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.25,0:34:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,…犯下和平抗争的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and commit acts of civil disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.09,0:34:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你们保证 要为罗库山大败负责的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you that those responsible for the catastrophe at Roku San…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.99,0:35:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…所有反对联邦政府的罪行 不论轻重大小…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and all crimes against the Federation, large and small…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.53,0:35:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都将受到惩罚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.17,0:35:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的战争是人类的宿命…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ours is a war of human destiny…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.07,0:35:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…结局只会有一个 那就是完全的胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that will end only in total victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.15,0:35:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,演说完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.49,0:35:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's wrap it up. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.33,0:35:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.10,0:35:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 将军？你看来不是很满意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, general? You don't look very happy with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.37,0:35:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都明白 必须稳定民心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all understand the need to maintain stability…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.87,0:35:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们找到空军指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until we locate the sky marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.67,0:35:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很讶异见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.01,0:35:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你要花点时间 才能走出伤痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd take some time to recover from your ordeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.38,0:35:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军指挥官会希望我 坐镇办公室的 上将{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sky marshal would want me in the office, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.28,0:35:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.53,0:36:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,（地球司令部）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.13,0:36:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.34,0:36:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 少尉？- 我姓兰柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lieutenant? - Lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.47,0:36:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,（密件）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.01,0:36:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道不该提起这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know no one's supposed to talk about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但空军指挥官的事我很遗憾 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'm sorry about the sky marshal, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是机密 少尉 菲德会让你受绞刑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's classified, lieutenant. Phid will have your head in a noose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.16,0:37:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.56,0:37:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.76,0:37:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族隔离区昨天传来 求救讯号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A distress call came out of the AQZ yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.20,0:37:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你会知道 而我却不知情？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are you aware of this and I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.47,0:37:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是在我值班时传来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transmission came through on my watch, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.08,0:37:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,（方位座标保密）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.75,0:37:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号呼叫救援舰 听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform to Fleet Rescue. Come in, Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.12,0:37:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号 这里是救援舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform, this is Fleet Rescue, over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.68,0:37:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求优先接回 空军指挥官外加五名船员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requesting priority pickup for sky marshal plus five.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.96,0:37:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上报之后结果呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened when you kicked it upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.03,0:37:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上级指示不予理会 包括之后的讯息在内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were instructed to ignore it, sir, and all future transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.63,0:37:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不该说出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm supposed to keep my mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.24,0:37:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么过来 少尉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That why you're here, lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.74,0:38:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在外孤立无援 没有人想办法营救{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out there all alone and no one's doing anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.34,0:38:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.78,0:38:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没来过 少尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never here, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.55,0:38:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 从来没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.10,0:38:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,（艾诺萝菲德上将下令）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.47,0:38:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号呼叫救援舰 听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform to Fleet Rescue. Come in, Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.74,0:38:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号呼叫救援舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform to Fleet Rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.64,0:38:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fleet Rescue, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.38,0:38:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会来接我们吧 舰长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna come and get us, right, captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.65,0:38:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要多久才会到？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, like, how long till they get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.72,0:38:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.02,0:38:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,重覆一遍 席拉麦克号呼叫救援舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say again, Sierra Mike Uniform to Fleet Rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.06,0:38:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.43,0:38:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.53,0:39:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想联系不上了 金格 快出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we're getting through. Jingo, get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.74,0:39:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？我喜欢这里 好嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? I like it in here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.74,0:39:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,（太阳能电池耗尽 请充电）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.64,0:39:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳能电池需要充电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The solar cells need recharging.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.38,0:39:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没空在海边待上一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have time for a day at the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.73,0:39:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.40,0:39:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个还是一千个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One or 1000?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.73,0:39:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁敢说那里没军队？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's to say there's not an army out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.87,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 我什么都没看到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是侦察队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a scout.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.50,0:39:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须立刻离开这片海滩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get off this beach pronto, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.74,0:39:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下逃生舱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave the rescue pod?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.94,0:39:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些虫子出现时 你想退到大海里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want your back to the water when these Bugs show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.78,0:39:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my guest, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.38,0:39:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父 愿世人皆颂圣名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy name.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.75,0:39:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿您的国降临 愿您的旨意…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thy kingdom come. Thy will be done…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:39:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.66,0:39:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松点 舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.36,0:40:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不确定 把我们都吓死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't sure, and you're scaring us all to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.09,0:40:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,行在地上如同行在天上一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Earth as it is in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.20,0:40:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们日用的饮食 今日赐给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us this day our daily bread and del…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.37,0:40:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的快把我逼疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are really getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.00,0:40:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没理由那样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got no cause to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.58,0:40:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手拿开 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hand off me, crew chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.22,0:40:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄痛他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.46,0:40:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都有思考的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's got a right to think what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.76,0:40:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 只要他们放在心里就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, as long as they keep it to themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.60,0:40:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿装备 我们要走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saddle up. We're moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.00,0:40:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 救援舰来找我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. When Fleet Rescue comes looking for us…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.17,0:40:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会先到这里吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is the first place they're gonna come, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.77,0:40:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect they would, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.81,0:40:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们应该留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we should stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果虫族来袭 我们就躲到逃生舱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the Bugs do attack, we just fall right back to the pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.04,0:40:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,真聪明 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart thinking, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.01,0:40:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没遇过虫群吧 大个子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever been in a swarm, big man?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫群？天哪 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swarm? Oh, my God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.22,0:41:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会把逃生舱 当纸袋一样撕开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll tear this pod apart like a paper bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.72,0:41:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,神哪 救救我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.69,0:41:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好我们要走了 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, gear up, we're moving out. And that's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.90,0:41:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父 愿世人皆颂圣名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father, who art in heaven, hallowed be thy name…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.00,0:41:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝会说话吗 - 你错了 贝克舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can the God talk. - You're wrong, Captain Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.70,0:41:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝无所不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God is everywhere, surrounding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.31,0:41:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.51,0:41:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在用自己的方法 寻找上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us search for God in our own way…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.51,0:41:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们有没有自觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whether we know it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.91,0:41:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,您真的相信吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really believe that, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.45,0:41:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 荷莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Holly, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.72,0:41:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道您也是信徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea that you were one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.92,0:41:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们都可以去找上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, all of you guys can go look for God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.59,0:41:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去登陆舱那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading for the Fleet marine lander.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.06,0:41:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有武器 说不定还有能用的通讯器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got weapons, maybe even a com that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.77,0:41:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且只有一百公里远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's only about a hundred klicks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.83,0:41:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一百公里远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a hundred klicks away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.14,0:41:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的存粮撑不了那么远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't got rations for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.67,0:41:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是胖子 不需要吃 出发了 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fat. You won't need any. Let's move, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.00,0:42:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼瑞哥上校 因为不服从命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel John Rico, for incompetence of command…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.80,0:42:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,（阿拉莫湾联邦监狱）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.73,0:42:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击长官 蓄意疏忽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}assault on a superior officer, and willful negligence…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,导致数名士兵 在你的指挥下丧命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}resulting in the deaths of several soldiers under your…command…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.57,0:42:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被判以绞刑处死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are sentenced to hang by the neck until you are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.38,0:42:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,（立刻生效）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.38,0:42:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,行刑前你有什么话要说吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have anything to say before the sentence is carried out?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.49,0:42:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on with it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.46,0:42:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们地狱见吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.36,0:43:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.17,0:43:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天走运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.07,0:43:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报局 这是机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligence. Classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.34,0:43:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢说出去 下次就轮你上绞刑台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk, and next time it's your neck in the noose.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.51,0:43:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.95,0:43:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想亲手吊死我吗 狄克斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna hang me yourself, Dix?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.75,0:43:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我有更好的事让你做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I got some better things for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.02,0:43:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你常来这里吧 狄克斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come here a lot, don't you, Dix?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.62,0:43:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你对政治犯有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know you were interested in political prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.33,0:43:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的意思 我是跟空军指挥官来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me. I come with the sky marshal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.73,0:43:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来审问的 - 艾诺克喜欢接触人群啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Interrogations. - Anoke likes the personal touch, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.76,0:44:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样 不是人类囚犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like you think. Not human prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.80,0:44:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在P星球抓到的 第一个首脑就关在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That first Brain, the one you captured on P, we keep it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.20,0:44:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它还活着？- 还长大了呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's still alive? - Alive and a lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.77,0:44:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道它们能活多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one really knows how long they live.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.11,0:44:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么用处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it good for?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.38,0:44:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾诺克深深为它着迷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anoke was fascinated by that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.82,0:44:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命为何突然值钱了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's my neck suddenly worth more than a piece of rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.65,0:44:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,事关联邦的未来 强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the future of the Federation, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.66,0:44:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有萝拉 - 那跟我有什么关系？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Lola. - What's that got to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.62,0:44:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只信得过你 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're the only one I can trust. - Why's that, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.20,0:44:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为大家都认为你死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because everyone thinks you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.27,0:45:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,（确认7只）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.94,0:45:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,（继续扫描）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.14,0:45:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,（确认16只）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.74,0:45:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舰长？- 我看到了 金格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain? - I see them, Jingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.21,0:45:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到16只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.12,0:45:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫子？在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugs? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.02,0:45:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 它们为什么停下来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - Why did they stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.53,0:45:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.70,0:45:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布尔 - 干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bull. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.93,0:45:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟我殿后 - 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You with me. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.81,0:45:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在赶集我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're herding us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.71,0:45:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？它们可以轻易干掉我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? They could have us easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.81,0:45:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们受到 上天的眷顾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we find ourselves under the grace of a higher power.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.92,0:45:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,您真的这么想吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think so, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.75,0:46:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心知肚明 荷莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it in my heart, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.97,0:46:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,您真的认为 我们受到上天保护？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think we're protected by some higher power?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.74,0:46:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱歌没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Singing can't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.01,0:46:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,提振士气还能杀时间 你不认为吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifts the spirit and helps pass the time, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.52,0:46:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我们没死 但我们早该挂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're not dead and we should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.79,0:46:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.89,0:47:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它巨大致命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big. It's deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.09,0:47:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,（Q弹争论）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.29,0:47:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都对新的Q弹有意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone's got an opinion about the new Q-bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.56,0:47:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,政客与民众担心传言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Politicians and citizens alike worry about the morality of a bomb…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.87,0:47:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种炸弹威力大到 能炸毁星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rumored to be so powerful it can crack a planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.20,0:47:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,发明一种武器 能够摧毁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creation of a weapon that can destroy the very planet…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.94,0:47:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我佇立的这个星球 对全人类来说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on which I now stand is nothing if not a dangerous precedent…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.31,0:47:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都是一个危险的先例{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the entire human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.55,0:47:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们不懂的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What people fail to grasp…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.01,0:47:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…宇宙间有好多星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is how many planets there are in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.45,0:47:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙本身就经常 摧毁其它星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that the universe itself often destroys other planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.72,0:47:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦政府不能决定 一个星球的生与死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation can't decide which planet lives and which planet dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.32,0:47:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上天的赐与 只有上天能收回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord giveth and the Lord taketh away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.90,0:47:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族如果有Q弹 你以为它们就不会用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think those dirty Bugs wouldn't use a Q-bomb if they had one?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.57,0:47:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不是应该 更优于虫族吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But aren't we supposed to be better than the Bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.14,0:47:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你说的 妈 这就是Q弹的争论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it, Mom. That's controversy with a Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.74,0:48:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道更多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.81,0:48:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,（加入舰队 尽一份力）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.01,0:48:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,（今天就加入！）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.35,0:48:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天我载士兵前往战区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday I dropped troopers into a combat zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.25,0:48:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我要飞往外太空殖民地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today I'm flying to the outer colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.48,0:48:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是舰队的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.79,0:48:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是舰队的一员 - 我们都是舰队的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Fleet too. - We're Fleet too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.09,0:48:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要飞行员 我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need pilots. We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.86,0:48:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.16,0:48:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你数学能力强 反射指数高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have strong math skills, high reflex index…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.86,0:48:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,HED高于8点1 我们现在就需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and an HED of 8.1 or better, we need you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.56,0:48:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,十六岁？没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixteen? No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.90,0:48:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就开始 为你的未来受训{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start training today for your future, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.40,0:48:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家说男生HED不佳 但我例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People say boys don't give good HED. But I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.17,0:48:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入舰队 你的未来无可限量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you go Fleet, there's no telling where you'll end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.01,0:48:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年轻的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I was young…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.51,0:48:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦想着有一天 我会驾驶星舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I dreamed that one day I'd fly a starship…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.25,0:48:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是拜访圣域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or even visit Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.61,0:48:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队带我登上高峰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fleet has taken me to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.25,0:48:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入舰队 能飞多高由你决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How high you fly is up to you when you go Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.69,0:48:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不今天就加入我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why not do your part and sign up today?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.26,0:48:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们驾驶舱见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.39,0:48:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道更多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.90,0:49:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,（圣域 联邦舰队之家）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.77,0:49:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,（方位保密）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.04,0:49:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.68,0:49:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你初次来到圣域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your first time at Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.59,0:49:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是惊人 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So this is the big wow. - This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.59,0:49:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是虫族发现这里 它们就会击溃舰队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Bugs find this place, they'll knock out the Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.53,0:49:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有外太空殖民地 机动步兵团守不住的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Fleet, you lose the outer colonies. Mobile Infantry couldn't hold them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.00,0:49:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是邻近一带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.70,0:49:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下一站就是地球 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Next stop, Earth. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.30,0:49:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以圣域是战争的最大秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess that makes Sanctuary the biggest secret of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.11,0:49:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连空军指挥官都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even the sky marshal knows where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.54,0:49:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有几个值得信任的 现役飞行员知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a handful of active-duty pilots are entrusted with that information.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.95,0:49:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.08,0:49:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝拉是其中之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.69,0:49:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 如果找不到她 我们就完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, and if we don't find her, we're sunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.39,0:50:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,（星舰示罗 雅典娜级）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.26,0:50:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,（掠夺者计划）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.77,0:50:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要派你去虫族隔黎区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending you to the Arachnid Quarantine Zone…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.20,0:50:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好就出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as soon as you saddle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.34,0:50:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对这个星球 了解多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we know about this planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.31,0:50:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,OM一号？一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OM-1? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,连确切位置都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even have its exact position.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.74,0:50:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救讯号呢？没有信号吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rescue call? Wasn't there a beacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.18,0:50:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾诺萝菲德不想救艾诺克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enolo Phid doesn't want Anoke rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.72,0:50:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不懂 - 菲德想当艾诺克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't get it. - Phid wants to be Anoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.85,0:50:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴我只需要 打虫子就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad all I do is fight Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.62,0:50:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会弄到座标让你去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna get the coordinates and you go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.93,0:50:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.46,0:50:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你凭什么这么肯定 他们还活着？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what makes you so sure they're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.76,0:50:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝拉很难死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Lola's hard to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.93,0:50:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是秘密任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this mission is off the books…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.73,0:50:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么给我军团 入侵虫族隔离区？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how are you gonna get me a regiment to invade the AQZ?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.54,0:50:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,军团？差的远了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A regiment? Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.51,0:50:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我有几个大兵？- 七个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So how many troopers do I get? - Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.71,0:50:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 包括你在内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - That's including you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.25,0:51:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只派个步枪队 跟我去虫族的家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sending me into the Bug house with a rifle squad?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.45,0:51:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不干脆让他们 吊死我算了 狄克斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just let them hang me, Dix?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.79,0:51:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我是该那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧 我正在召集你的组员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'm assembling your team now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.83,0:51:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的葬礼 我要自己挑组员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my funeral. My pick of the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.07,0:51:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你高兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any way you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.85,0:51:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是很漂亮 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't much to look at, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.62,0:51:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打造它们 不是做漂亮的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we didn't build them to do pretty things.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.77,0:51:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.74,0:51:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他几时信教的？- 我不会说是信教{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When did he get the religion? - I wouldn't call it religion per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.61,0:51:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是精神上的 - 那不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's spiritual. - That's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.88,0:52:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个月前 我半夜接到电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, two months ago, I received a call in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.22,0:52:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个礼拜没见到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't seen him for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.42,0:52:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他去了沙漠 接受测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me he'd been in the desert and that he'd been tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.12,0:52:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变得不一样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.76,0:52:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.96,0:52:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人 就算是圣人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, every man, even great men…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.56,0:52:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们疲累害怕的时候 都会心存疑虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…experience moments of doubt when they're tired and afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.36,0:52:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.03,0:52:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这场战争永远不会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me that this was a war that would never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.36,0:52:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们这样下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That if we stay this course…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.70,0:52:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族将来一定会 摧毁人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the Bugs will and must destroy the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.17,0:52:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's lost his nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.47,0:52:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 十分满分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extraordinary, 10 out of 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.11,0:52:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他病情复发 我给他开镇静剂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had an episode. I gave him a sedative.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.74,0:52:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔天他叫我不用担心 他和上帝谈过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day he told me not to worry, that he'd talked to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.12,0:52:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我说我和上帝对话 你会不准我驾驶吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, if I told you I was talking to God, would you clear me for flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.52,0:52:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.42,0:52:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军指挥官是否不适合指挥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the SM unfit for command?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.46,0:52:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这段对话 很不舒服 舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find this a very uncomfortable conversation, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.83,0:52:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要接手指挥 就会需要你的协助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I need to assume command, I'm gonna need your help…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.56,0:53:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为其它人不会懂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because the others won't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.57,0:53:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个都会被处死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could both hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.84,0:53:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是效忠空军指挥官还是对联邦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your loyalty to the SM or the Federation?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.63,0:53:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怪厨师 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame the cook, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.93,0:53:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军指挥官先吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The SM goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.50,0:53:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有水而已 布尔 你吃我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just water. Bull, you have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.70,0:53:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.90,0:53:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我们会需要你的体力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure we'll need your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.41,0:53:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.58,0:53:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您不介意 我们饭前可以祷告吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind, can we maybe say a prayer before we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.38,0:53:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.45,0:53:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Wiggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.32,0:53:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长 你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.33,0:54:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查看边界 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be checking the perimeter, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.86,0:54:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢主赐给我们这顿饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thank thee, Lord, for the meal we're about to receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.24,0:54:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,请保佑我们 守护我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please bless us and keep us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.77,0:54:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我们避开邪恶 引领我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect us from all evil and guide us…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.98,0:54:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们知道走向你的路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that we may know the way to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.21,0:54:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.41,0:54:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.33,0:54:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以请教您 一个问题吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.46,0:54:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.90,0:54:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会来找我们吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are gonna come looking for us, won't they, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.87,0:54:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有你在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.40,0:54:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务是最重要的 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are on a mission of the greatest importance, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.77,0:54:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们现在 并不清楚目的何在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we do not now understand our purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.74,0:54:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官 但我们会获救的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. But we are gonna be rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.25,0:54:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点你很清楚吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you do know that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.51,0:54:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是通灵战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.68,0:55:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道周围人的感受 有时也能和他们对话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how people around me feel, and sometimes I can speak to them…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.62,0:55:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没人能预测未来 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but no one can predict the future, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.95,0:55:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.58,0:55:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要请教你们大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.86,0:55:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有信仰吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.66,0:55:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.86,0:55:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有 荷莉 你的信仰明确且虔诚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you do, Holly. Your faith is clear and serene.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.07,0:55:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想要有 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna believe too, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.17,0:55:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.61,0:55:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是个开始 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the start of it, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.68,0:56:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯医生 你呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Wiggs, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.75,0:56:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.39,0:56:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 威斯医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, careful now, Dr. Wiggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.63,0:56:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我只是一介凡人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm only a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.90,0:56:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,地震{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.27,0:56:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人来袭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.84,0:56:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人来袭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.89,0:57:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我！布尔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.79,0:57:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金格 - 撑住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jingo, Jingo. - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.60,0:57:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 金格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Jingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.64,0:57:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 加油{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.82,0:57:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.96,0:57:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Wiggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.86,0:57:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Wiggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.23,0:58:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Wiggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.30,0:58:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.83,0:58:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.74,0:58:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.54,0:58:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.18,0:58:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴又见到你们 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you again, troopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.21,0:58:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们都参与了 一项机密任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are now all part of a classified mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.92,0:58:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出去你就会被处死 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about it and they will hang you. Get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.59,0:58:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.85,0:58:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问掠夺者计划 究竟是什么 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is the Marauder program, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.92,0:58:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我目前不便透露 - 这项任务会送死吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not currently at liberty to say. - Sir, is the mission survivable, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.63,0:58:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会知道的 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out, trooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.90,0:58:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我怎么想吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.64,0:58:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么想 少尉？- 今天是慷慨赴义的好日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that, sergeant? - I think it's a good day to die, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.44,0:58:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 很高兴你这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding. Glad you feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.78,0:58:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为今天我们要前往 虫族隔离区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because today, we're headed out for the Arachnid Quarantine Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.75,0:58:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备出发 大兵 - 遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Saddle up, troopers. - Sir, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.59,0:59:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪泽呼叫兰柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hauzer for Lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.73,0:59:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 将军 兰柏少尉被调职了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, general, Lieutenant Lamb's been transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.70,0:59:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,调去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.04,0:59:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官 我不能告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir, I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.74,0:59:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,（搜寻中）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.28,0:59:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,（状态：等待处死 | 罪名：煽动罪）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.65,0:59:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,（签署人：艾诺萝菲德上将）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.92,0:59:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.83,0:59:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狄克斯 请进 - 你要吊死兰柏？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dix, come in. - You are going to hang Lamb?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.43,0:59:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,红发小女孩 眼神悲伤 有张大嘴巴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little redhead, sad eyes, big mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.90,0:59:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.40,0:59:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是叛徒的下场 狄克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what happens to traitors, Dix.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.84,0:59:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你很了解叛徒 上将{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like you know all about traitors, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.54,0:59:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我现在 正看着一个叛徒呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm looking at one right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.15,0:59:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要把我吊死？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna hang me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.75,0:59:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事这阵子很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a lot of that going around these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.15,1:00:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果被议会发现 你压制空军指挥官的求救讯号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens to you when the council finds out…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.59,1:00:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会有什么下场呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you suppressed the sky marshal's rescue call?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.95,1:00:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会告诉他们这种事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And exactly who would tell them such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.13,1:00:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把OM一号星球的 座标告诉我然后辞职{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me the coordinates for Planet OM-1, resign…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.63,1:00:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会说出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I keep my mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.80,1:00:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 狄克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dix.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.14,1:00:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但欧马艾诺克很快就会身亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But very shortly, Omar Anoke will be dead…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.20,1:00:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被尊为联邦的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and honored as a hero of the Federation…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.44,1:00:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我会成为下一任空军指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I will be the next sky marshal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.01,1:00:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你先干掉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over my dead body.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.21,1:00:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你最后的要求吗 将军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That your last request, general?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.90,1:00:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,（新闻快报）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.60,1:00:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦议员今日齐聚一堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal Council members were called together today…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.34,1:00:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听取空军指挥官艾诺克例行周报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by Sky Marshal Anoke for his weekly report.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.74,1:00:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing, sir? Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.94,1:00:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…悲剧发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then… disaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.75,1:01:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈尼夫和平联盟成员 携带炸弹引爆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bomb carried by a member of the Goniff Peace Coalition explodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.15,1:01:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,失踪名单包括{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among the missing:
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.42,1:01:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军指挥官艾诺克及其忠贞的助手 狄克斯豪泽将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sky Marshal Anoke and his loyal aide, General Dix Hauzer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.39,1:01:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我们每一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, each and every one of us…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.19,1:01:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都受到了攻击 而攻击的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has been attacked by a man…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.20,1:01:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣称不惜一切代价 要求和平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who would demand peace at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.40,1:01:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自称是公民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who calls himself a citizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.70,1:01:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实比虫族还不如{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who is no better than a Bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.01,1:01:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再多打一天… - 那个人就是艾莫戈尼夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One more day of fighting… - That man is Elmo Goniff…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.38,1:01:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,自称和平主义者 却成了恐怖份子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…self-proclaimed pacifist turned terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.35,1:01:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 他与戈尼夫和平联盟 的其它成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And today, he and other members of the Goniff Peace Coalition…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.45,1:01:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都因为与议会爆炸案有关 而遭到通缉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are wanted in connection with the council bombing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.82,1:01:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小市民 你可以帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, hey, citizen, you can help.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.82,1:01:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去认识你的邻居 - 把那鬼东西拿开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Know your neighbors? - Turn that f***ing thing off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.26,1:01:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再看一眼 公民 - 你说我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take another look, citizen. - Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.70,1:01:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能就住在 一大笔赏金的隔壁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be living next door to a big, fat reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.20,1:01:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么就说出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see something, say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.00,1:01:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道更多吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to know more?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.00,1:02:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是虫族隔离区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the Arachnid Quarantine Zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.94,1:02:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么意思吗？这是虫族的星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what that means? This is a Bug planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.41,1:02:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们随时会来抓我们 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could come for us at any time, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.54,1:02:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天上地下谁晓得 - 省省吧 金格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Upstairs, downstairs, you can't tell. - Save your breath, Jingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.01,1:02:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们搞不好就在脚下 你又不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they could be under our feet right now. You can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.18,1:02:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不知道吧？- 听我说好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know, right? - Listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.69,1:02:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你什么时候跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you when to run.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.29,1:02:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不会告诉我什么时候跑 因为我是厨师 懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't tell me when to run, because I'm a cook, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.49,1:02:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受快速点餐 我不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take short orders, I'm not a…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.60,1:02:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我振作一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your shit wired.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.70,1:02:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个恶婆娘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.44,1:02:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.08,1:02:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在浪费水 金格 - 我恨你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're wasting water, Jingo. - I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.71,1:03:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 - 没事的 荷莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - It's okay, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.05,1:03:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我要离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's it, I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.85,1:03:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地 金格 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your ground, Jingo. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.25,1:03:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长 我们需要谈一谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.62,1:03:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是天杀的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.89,1:03:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我一直在说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what I've been saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.76,1:03:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该那样说 那是亵渎神明的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't talk like that. That's blasphemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.13,1:03:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个该死的空服员 少废话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a goddamn flight attendant, so stow it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.44,1:03:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不该离开海滩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never should have left the goddamn beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.60,1:03:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是大错特错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.41,1:03:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们有战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we got warriors…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.58,1:03:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的地震 还失去了医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fucking earthquakes, and we even lost the doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.81,1:03:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们忘了吗？这都是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you forget that? And it's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.65,1:03:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们留在海滩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if we'd stayed at the beach…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.65,1:03:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能躺在沙滩上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then we could just be lying in the sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.16,1:04:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果虫族出现 我们就跳进海里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the Bugs did show up, well, then we just jump in the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.93,1:04:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族不会游泳 对吧？它们会吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Bugs don't swim, right? Do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.86,1:04:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金格 你背后 - 金格 小心背后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jingo, behind you. - Jingo, watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.74,1:04:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 很好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.34,1:04:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？去你们的 我要回去海滩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Screw you guys. I'm going back to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.18,1:04:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金格 - 金格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jingo. - Jingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.66,1:04:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,金格 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jingo, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.46,1:04:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 金格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Jingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.50,1:04:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.71,1:04:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.35,1:05:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它走掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moving off.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.42,1:05:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火 省省子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire. Save the ammo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.76,1:05:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金格 马上出来 - 才不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jingo, get out of there, now. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.86,1:05:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该进去陪他 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ought to get in there with him. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.03,1:05:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 那不是石头 快离开那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief, those aren't rocks. Get out of there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 荷莉 长官 - 不 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Holly, let's go. Sir, let's go. - No, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.67,1:05:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是属於上帝的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He belongs to God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.24,1:05:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.23,1:05:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.26,1:06:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.86,1:06:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.14,1:06:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你的上帝在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's your God now?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.71,1:06:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.11,1:06:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你不信 舰长 他也有在听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though you don't believe it, captain, he is listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.42,1:06:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们很快就会得救 - 你真的相信吗 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And soon, we will be delivered. - Do you really believe that, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.19,1:06:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 荷莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.56,1:06:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.93,1:06:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.30,1:07:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他现在就在跟我对话 贝克舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he talks to me even now, Captain Beck.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.61,1:07:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在就在跟我对话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talks to me even now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.86,1:07:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听好 你们操作的硬碟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up. The hardware you'll be operating…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.66,1:07:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,会和你们的神经系统 直接连结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…interfaces directly with your nervous system.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.36,1:07:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's outstanding, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.43,1:07:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请脱掉衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please remove your clothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.38,1:07:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不买农场 你会做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do if you don't buy the farm?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.75,1:07:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想退休 他们说不定会让我们回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking R and R. They might even let us go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.75,1:07:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,家？那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.35,1:07:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,平静安详和家人 记得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace and quiet, family. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.42,1:07:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 事情结束后 我要的就是那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's all I want when this is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.89,1:07:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及重新来过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I just can't wait for it to be over and start living again.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.53,1:07:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人跟你说过吗 中士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't anybody told you, sergeants?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.30,1:08:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,死是机动步兵团 唯一的归宿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mobile Infantry is only good for dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.13,1:08:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须想出更大的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to come up with a bigger weapon…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.37,1:08:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能解决这件事 我们才能回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so they can finish this thing and we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.94,1:08:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 虫虫再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Bye-bye, Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.71,1:08:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争结束你要做什么 长官？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you do when the war is over, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.88,1:08:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说什么？这场战争永远不会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you people talking about? This war is never gonna end.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.50,1:08:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,二号请就位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your place, number two.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.44,1:08:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪他妈妈叫他鼻涕虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's why his mama called him Slug.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.95,1:08:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备进行全光谱生物扫描{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for full-spectrum bioscan.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.45,1:08:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,DDQ五乘五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}DDQ, five-by-five.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.76,1:08:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始进行珈玛扫描{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commencing Gamma Jetta Bonza.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.78,1:09:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,（神经机械介面完成）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.45,1:09:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,（掠夺者小组就绪）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.38,1:09:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,（艾拉莫湾地下研究机构）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.39,1:09:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有参与艾诺克 审问首脑吗 将军？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you participate in Anoke's interrogation of the Brain, general?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.76,1:09:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.96,1:09:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不知道副作用？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't know about the side effects?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.90,1:09:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么副作用？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What side effects?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.83,1:09:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来只要是和那只虫 相处太久的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems anybody who spends too much time around that Bug…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.77,1:09:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会出现幻觉 包括生理与心理上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…suffers deleterious effects, both physical and psychological.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.31,1:09:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 空军指挥官没有 - 看来是如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not the sky marshal. - So it seemed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.28,1:09:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我们不完全知道 首脑的本事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, we didn't fully understand the Brain's capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.66,1:10:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官好 - 欢迎来到第六区 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. - Welcome to Area 6, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.13,1:10:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只准必要人士进入 - 遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Necessary personnel only. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.10,1:10:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有未经许可的人士 请立刻离开第六区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All unauthorized personnel, exit Area 6 immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.07,1:10:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有未经许可的人士 请立刻离开第六区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All unauthorized personnel, exit Area 6 immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.95,1:10:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 你对空军指挥官的了解 究竟有多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, general, how well did you really know the sky marshal?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.35,1:10:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天和他共事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked with him every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.59,1:10:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你知道他有了信仰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you knew he got religion.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.43,1:10:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在说什么？- 将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - General.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.86,1:10:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想有个东西你该看一看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I think you should see.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.14,1:10:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开艾诺克档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run the Anoke file.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.81,1:10:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是艾诺克和首脑虫的 监视录影划片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is surveillance footage of Anoke with the Brain Bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.11,1:11:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最近才发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just recently discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.81,1:11:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做心灵接触 他们在沟通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's psychically connected with it. They communicate.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.98,1:11:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.12,1:11:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来此做你的仆人 毕罕科托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I come here as your servant, Behemecoytal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.29,1:11:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那玩意儿有名字？- 对 但不是这只虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That thing has a name? - Yeah. But that's not this Bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.46,1:11:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕罕科托很可能 是我们没见过的某只虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behemecoytal is likely some Bug we've never encountered before.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.90,1:11:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,源自OM一号星球的 高等虫族智慧生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A superior arachnid intelligence originating on the planet OM-1.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.87,1:11:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,OM一号？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}OM-1?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.07,1:11:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信这个首脑 是自愿被捕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe this Brain allowed itself to be captured.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.67,1:11:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供来自联邦核心的情报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To provide intelligence from the heart of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.64,1:11:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾诺克利用首脑 和这个毕罕科托连系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Anoke used the Brain to commune with this Behemecoytal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.51,1:11:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他视那只虫为上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Bug he regards as God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.95,1:11:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 罗库山会打败仗 以证实我的信仰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Roku San will fall as proof of my faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.18,1:11:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就能来谈 和平的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can discuss the terms of peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.72,1:11:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾诺克要为罗库山负责？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anoke's responsible for Roku San?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.76,1:11:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有关闭围栏的密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had the codes to shut down the fences.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.13,1:11:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和虫子签下协议 让罗库山无力抵抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made a pact with the Bug to render Roku San defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.50,1:11:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据他的转变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in light of his conversion…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.70,1:12:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成了虫族的资产 对我们则大不利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he's become an asset to the Bugs and a tremendous liability for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.50,1:12:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 艾诺克在OM一号做什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the real question is, what's Anoke doing in OM-1?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.14,1:12:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 交朋友？- 你不能和一直虫子交朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Making friends? - You can't be friends with a Bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.78,1:12:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要解决这一只{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're gonna put this one down…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.92,1:12:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拆了它 查出它知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…take it apart, and find out what it knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.86,1:12:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭围墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the containment.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.71,1:13:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,上将 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.71,1:13:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.98,1:13:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.82,1:13:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.75,1:13:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系最有权力的人 找到了上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most powerful man in the galaxy finds God…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.96,1:13:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and what does he do?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.13,1:13:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,照对方说的去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what he's told.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.46,1:13:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是虫子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.30,1:13:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会想 不会抗议 不会造反{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't think, doesn't protest, doesn't rebel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.57,1:13:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种态度才能打蠃战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the kind of attitude that wins wars.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.87,1:13:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 狄克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dix…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.34,1:13:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这些虫子在算计什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I think these Bugs are onto something.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.71,1:13:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这搞不好是它们 最厉害的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could just be the greatest weapon of them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.59,1:14:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么办到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.79,1:14:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是信仰 布尔 那样才叫男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's faith, Bull. That's what it does for a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.93,1:14:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.73,1:14:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰比Q弹更厉害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faith is more powerful than a Q-bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.50,1:14:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有信仰 你什么都不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without it, you're nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.17,1:14:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不要 再听你的话了 舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm not listening to you anymore, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.04,1:14:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷莉 如果我们能逃出去 我在想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holly, if we ever get out of this, I was wondering if…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.28,1:14:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.08,1:14:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样 布尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Bull?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.29,1:14:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给 我这种大老粗吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you ever marry an old monkey wrench like me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.26,1:14:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要是在教堂就行 布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in a church, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.99,1:14:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.06,1:14:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接受上帝 就能娶到我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take God and you can take me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.10,1:14:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we've come for.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.60,1:14:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.41,1:14:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未怀疑过 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never doubted it for a second, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.95,1:15:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我以前不信 现在也信了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't believe before, I do now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.02,1:15:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 一切会没事的 - 你会如愿的 比尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, everything's gonna be okay. - All will be well, Bull.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.92,1:15:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道上帝的名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will know the name of God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.56,1:15:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one true God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.13,1:15:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕罕科托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behemecoytal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.70,1:15:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,首脑之脑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brain of Brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.47,1:15:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毕罕什么？- 毕罕科托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beheme-what? - Behemecoytal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.00,1:15:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里 他无所不在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here. He's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.37,1:15:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们去休息 等待他的到来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, and let us rest and wait for his coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.55,1:15:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家说上帝有好多名字 但我从没听过这一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say God has many names, but I've never heard that one before.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.02,1:15:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 他是飞官 他懂的比我们多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, honey, he's the sky marshal. He knows a lot more than we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.25,1:15:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的是虫子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's talking about a Bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.09,1:15:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为上帝是虫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks God is a Bug?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.02,1:15:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有信仰 虫族的信仰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got religion. Their religion.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.93,1:15:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 虫族的信仰？- 太扯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bug religion? - That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.93,1:15:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是亵渎神明的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's blasphemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.43,1:15:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.34,1:15:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.87,1:15:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？因为他疯了？还是因为他像你一样信神？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, because he's crazy? Or he believes in God like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.18,1:16:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他信错神了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the wrong God.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.50,1:16:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去守门 - 我不是步兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guard the door. - I'm no trooper.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.27,1:16:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 公民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.99,1:17:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过一下 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.27,1:17:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出了什么错？- 漏气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What went wrong? - An air leak.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.94,1:17:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,船身自行着地的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship landed itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.01,1:17:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进入大气层前就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were dead before they hit the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.20,1:18:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号呼叫救援舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform to Fleet Rescue.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.14,1:18:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.61,1:18:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号呼叫救援舰 听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform to Fleet Rescue. Come in, Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.71,1:18:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能解决氧气问题 就能飞上轨道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could make orbit if I can solve the O2 problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.38,1:18:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定它 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solve it, chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.15,1:18:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号呼叫救援舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform to Fleet Rescue.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.82,1:18:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到请回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.12,1:18:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉麦克号 这里是救援舰 请说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sierra Mike Uniform, this is Fleet Rescue, over.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.16,1:18:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求优先接回 OM一号星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are requesting priority pickup on Planet Oscar Mike-One…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.60,1:18:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括飞官和另外三名生还者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for SM and three additional survivors.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.40,1:19:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,荷莉 不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holly, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.11,1:19:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.08,1:19:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.82,1:20:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bull.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.03,1:20:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.57,1:20:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.67,1:20:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们到处都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all around.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.94,1:20:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是毕罕科托 - 不 是地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Behemecoytal. - No, it's hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.21,1:20:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 荷莉 - 这是地狱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Holly. - We're in hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.71,1:20:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门关上 荷莉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the door, Holly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.12,1:20:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许无法上轨道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may not be able to make orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.24,1:20:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我们肯定能离开这里 - 我们必须留下 舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But we can sure get out of here. - We must remain here, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.34,1:20:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 长官 我们要离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, we are off this rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.61,1:22:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的主啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great one. Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.42,1:22:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一天终於到来 我就站在你面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day has arrived that I stand before you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.22,1:22:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们开始交流吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let our communion begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.63,1:22:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.53,1:22:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.73,1:22:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候交谈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.07,1:22:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,金格 是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jingo, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.10,1:22:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替我们发言 我们得以用人类语言交谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one speaks for us that we may talk to you as a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.11,1:22:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们和自己人对话 应该会比较自在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you may be comfortable among your own kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.91,1:22:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们信任的顾问与仆人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Among your trusted advisors and servants…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.78,1:22:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了我们的信徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whom we have made believers.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.42,1:22:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.92,1:22:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是如此在乎我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you care for me so much…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.26,1:22:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我充满爱与喜乐 还有自信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fills me with love and joy and confidence…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.03,1:23:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以也将会 建立全新的认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that we can and will create a great new understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.57,1:23:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将成为我们的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be one with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.84,1:23:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就会了解你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I may come to know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.84,1:23:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会了解 我们知道的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will know what we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.38,1:23:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会了解我 并且透过我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you will come to know me, and through me…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.88,1:23:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解全人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.32,1:23:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.52,1:23:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来跟比我们优越的种族 做和平协商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here to negotiate peace with a being superior to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.32,1:23:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 姑息它们吗？- 不 贝克舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, appeasement? - No, Captain Beck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.69,1:23:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谈人类的存活 我们都会得救{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The survival of the human race. We will all be saved.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.17,1:23:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,请见谅 我的人要学的还很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. My people have much to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.57,1:23:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们害怕又… - 跟你以前一样 艾诺克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are fearful and… - As were you once, Anoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.71,1:23:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经怯懦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.51,1:23:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求罗库山 那么多条生命 我怀疑过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you asked for the lives of so many at Roku San, I doubted.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.28,1:23:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我明白 伟大的成就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I understand that great achievement…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.02,1:23:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,都需要大量的牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…requires great sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.69,1:23:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把罗库山交给它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave them Roku San.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.66,1:24:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.10,1:24:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过那个女人 你会找到圣域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within that woman you will find Sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.90,1:24:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把解除冲突的关键 献给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have given you the key that will end this conflict once and for all…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.61,1:24:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的律法来统治 让乐园降临…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so that your law may rule and paradise follow…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.71,1:24:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是骗子 坏人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a liar. Seducer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.01,1:24:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奉主之名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He of a thousand names.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.98,1:24:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的主啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great one, Lord…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.99,1:24:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你带走这两个女人 杀了她们吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would you please take these women from me and kill them?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.43,1:24:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何希望这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why do you wish this?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.09,1:24:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走过这趟伟大的旅程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have made this great journey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.80,1:24:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进化了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have evolved.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.27,1:24:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我牺牲了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have sacrificed all…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.07,1:24:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我才能 与你创造大和平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so that I may create with you a great peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.57,1:24:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们却想搞砸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're fucking it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.81,1:24:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也寻求和平 只是方法不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We too seek peace, but by different means.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.71,1:24:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们寻求知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seek knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.22,1:25:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知识是理解…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowledge is the key to understanding…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.62,1:25:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,与沟通的关键{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and to communication.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.49,1:25:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有如此 我等一族…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only by this way can our species…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.46,1:25:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会与众不同 和谐共处 互荣…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so different, live together in harmony and mutual resp…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.83,1:25:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为我们的一员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will become one with us…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.97,1:25:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供必要的知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and provide the knowledge necessary…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.57,1:25:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,平定人类一族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to pacify the human species.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.35,1:25:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.55,1:25:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的计划 你们的军队配置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your plans, the disposition of your armies…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.72,1:25:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,和舰队配置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your fleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.56,1:25:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我的就是你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, what's mine is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.10,1:25:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我走 伟大的主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me unto you, oh, great one.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.57,1:25:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.71,1:26:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.23,1:26:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起祷告 萝拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray with me, Lola.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.26,1:26:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.70,1:26:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊 请听我的祷告 带我们离开这邪恶之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, please hear my prayer. Deliver us from this evil place.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.57,1:26:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 萝拉 跟我一起祷告 - 这有什么差别呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Lola, pray with me. - It doesn't make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.37,1:26:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,主啊 派给我们 一个天使军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, send us an army of angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.35,1:26:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们配备 你的火与你的剑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And arm them with your fire and your sword…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.65,1:26:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们歼灭 我们周围的邪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that they might smite the evil around us.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.75,1:26:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 萝拉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Lola?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.12,1:26:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萝拉 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lola, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.86,1:26:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 萝拉 难道你不想活吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lola, don't you wanna live?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.43,1:26:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I wanna live.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.63,1:26:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你希望尽失 上帝就是你仅有的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you're all out of hope, God is all you get.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.47,1:26:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.07,1:27:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的天父 - 我们的天父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our father. - Our father.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.37,1:27:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在天上的父 - 在天上的父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who art in heaven. - Who art in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.44,1:27:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿世人皆颂圣名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallowed be they name.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.86,1:27:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 愿您的国降临 - 愿您的国降临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thy kingdom come. - Thy kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.12,1:27:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 愿您的旨意 - 愿您的旨意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thy will be done. - Thy will be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.26,1:27:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行在地上如同行在天上 - 行在地上如同行在天上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On Earth as it is in heaven. - On Earth as it is in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.28,1:27:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大兵 歼灭这个虫穴 到处都是亚契{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, troopers, let's fix this hive. Archies everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.06,1:27:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,免我们的债 如同我们免了人的债{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we forgive those who trespass against us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.26,1:27:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 寻找生还者 - 不叫我们预见试探{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Searching for survivors. - And lead us not into temptation.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.80,1:28:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到了 - 救我们脱离邪恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got them. - And deliver us from evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.83,1:28:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.83,1:28:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolling in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.14,1:28:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolling in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.41,1:28:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got visual.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.75,1:28:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.09,1:28:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我的指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.96,1:28:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到了 接触敌人 - 等待指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got visual, we got contact. - Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.93,1:28:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就绪 等待指令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready. Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.67,1:28:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触敌人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.64,1:28:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拨枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm moving in for guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.01,1:28:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.18,1:28:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that line, trooper.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.08,1:28:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次 萝拉 再说一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it again, Lola. Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.32,1:29:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在天上的父 - 在天上的父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Our father who art in heaven. - Who art in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.89,1:29:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 愿世人皆颂圣名 - 愿世人皆颂圣名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hallowed by thy name. - Hallowed by thy name.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.73,1:29:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.53,1:29:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行在地上如同行在天上 - 行在地上如同行在天上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On Earth as it is in heaven. - On Earth as it is in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.91,1:29:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.64,1:29:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,用尽所有武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.08,1:29:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我倒数开始扫射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiate wide dispersal on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.05,1:29:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 二… - 免我们的债{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three, two… - And forgive us our trespasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.81,1:29:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.05,1:29:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀光它们 一个不留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weed them out. Nothing lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.20,1:29:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some, get some, get some.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.91,1:29:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚契{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archie.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.48,1:29:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dual target.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.45,1:29:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.18,1:30:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 宰了它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, cook them.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.03,1:30:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 萝拉 我们回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lola, let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.57,1:31:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那儿杀了一堆虫 强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed a lot of Bugs down there, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.64,1:31:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可惜大虫跑了 - 它是大虫嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Too bad the big one got away. - Well, it's a big Bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.98,1:31:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人搞不清楚 虫子在哪终结 星球从哪开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our guys can't tell where the Bug ends and the planet begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.95,1:31:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难想像有什么 能活着熬过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to imagine anything could live through all that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.55,1:31:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我办到啦 - 你很难死嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did. - You're hard to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.66,1:31:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫子好大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bug is big.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.30,1:31:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们锁定它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.40,1:32:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝克舰长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Beck.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.50,1:32:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,久仰大名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.41,1:32:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你来指挥我的旗舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping you'll take command of my flagship.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.68,1:32:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你要先休息一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you've had a little time off.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.71,1:32:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.05,1:32:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 瑞哥上校 掠夺者大成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Colonel Rico. Marauder is a big success.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.15,1:32:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢长官 - 谢谢狄克斯吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, ma'am. - Oh, thank Dix.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.55,1:32:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新副手 很少接受人家的拒绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new number two doesn't always take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.09,1:32:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定是否应该 寓公事于娱乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't sure we should mix business with pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.00,1:32:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备配置Q弹了吗？- 就等您一声令下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we ready to deploy the Q-bomb? - On your command.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.34,1:32:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我们去炸星球吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, people. Let's go crack a planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.78,1:32:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要上你升将军 强尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they wanna make you a general, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.68,1:32:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你负责整个掠夺者计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put you in charge of the whole Marauder program.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.92,1:32:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会做一件事 狄克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only good for one thing, Dix.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.92,1:32:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个小队 让我打仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a squad and let me fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.33,1:32:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少考虑一下嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.96,1:33:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你们两个想独处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you two wanna be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.73,1:33:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回程见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you on the bounce.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.54,1:33:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数计时 发射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha Gamma Bonza. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.58,1:33:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to ask you…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.51,1:33:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿不愿意…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.88,1:33:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.19,1:33:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.72,1:33:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 但你得知道一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's wonderful. - But you need to know one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.09,1:33:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.49,1:33:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在底下发生了一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to me down there and…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.66,1:33:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十秒后撞击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty seconds to impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.53,1:33:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我无法解释的事 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something that I can't explain. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.60,1:33:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要娶我 就得在教堂举行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you wanna marry me, we have to do it in a church.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.71,1:33:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 二十秒后撞击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Twenty seconds to impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.41,1:33:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信教了 狄克斯 信的很深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got religion, Dix. I got it bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.51,1:33:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.32,1:33:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人是完美的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nobody's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.02,1:34:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三 二 一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.63,1:34:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have detonation.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.64,1:34:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他离开了 但他留下了一首歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, he's gone, but he left us with a song.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.05,1:34:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,（现在就捐款 公民！）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.65,1:34:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,（你也能哀悼！）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.92,1:34:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.89,1:34:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.06,1:34:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣誉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.00,1:34:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,数百万人哀悼 空军指挥官欧·艾诺克的死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions mourn the passing of Sky Marshal Omar Anoke.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.74,1:34:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是战士 哲学家 是联邦的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warrior, philosopher, a hero of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.05,1:35:00.02,Title,0,0,0,0,,（收录畅销单曲 《慷慨赴义就在今天》）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.22,1:35:02.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《别再虫我》与《性感灵媒》）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.89,1:35:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦各地专家都同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Across the Federation, federal experts agree that, A…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.56,1:35:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 上帝是存在的 二 他站在我们这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…God exists after all, B, he's on our side…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.93,1:35:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 他要我们蠃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and, C, he wants us to win.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.73,1:35:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更好的消息 众信徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's even more good news, believers.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.37,1:35:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是官方消息 上帝回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's official. God's back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.51,1:35:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是个公民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's a citizen too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.28,1:35:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,屈于联邦各地人气攀升{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bowing to a rise in popularity all across the Federation…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.15,1:35:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲德空军指挥官宣布 宗教是可以接受的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Sky Marshal Phid declares that while religion is acceptable…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.82,1:35:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但和平则不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…peace is not.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.05,1:35:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它相关消息 和平恐怖份子艾莫戈尼夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In related news, peace terrorist Elmo Goniff…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.26,1:35:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,及其51名密友 今早被处以绞刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and 51 of his closest friends were hung this morning…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.86,1:35:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人相信 这是自21世纪以来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in what many believe to be the all-time record for executions…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.16,1:35:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,单日处决人数的最高纪录{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a single day since the 21 st century.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.10,1:35:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们无法让你沉默{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they can't silence you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.00,1:35:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的联邦 去你的！你们夺不走我的声音！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}F*** the Federation and f*** all of you! You will not take my voice!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.84,1:35:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们夺不走我！你们夺不走我们的权力！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not take me! You will not take away our power!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.98,1:36:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！去你的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}F*** you all! F*** you! F*** you all!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.28,1:36:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的联邦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}F*** the Federation!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.68,1:36:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争英雄休假结婚去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}War heroes take time out to tie the knot.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.25,1:36:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,（联邦名人敲响礼钟）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.75,1:36:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去工作吧 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to work, troopers.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.45,1:36:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人告诉你们吗？又有战争了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't anyone tell you? There's a war on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.69,1:36:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入军队尽一份力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So join up, do your part.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.89,1:36:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼前还有冗长的战争 我们需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a long war ahead, and we need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.28,1:36:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好当掠夺者了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready for Marauder?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.28,1:36:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入机动步兵团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join the Mobile Infantry…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.72,1:36:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入机动步兵团看你是不是当公民的料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and see if you've got what it takes to be a citizen.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.62,1:36:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回程见了 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you on the bounce, trooper.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.79,1:36:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,服役就能获得公民权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Service guarantees citizenship.
